      "syntax": "for (var i: int = 0; i < 3; i = i + 1) bound 3",
      "context": "Header of the loop in ControlFlowNotation::Counter.countedLoop. The initializer, test, body and update are ordered inside one owned loop.",
      "rules": [
        "Draw an owned loop frame with an initializer before the condition, a true edge to the body, an update after the body and an explicit edge back to the test. Label the false normal exit and the positive bound.",
        "Show a LoopBound failure on an excess requested body. The initializer runs once even if the body runs zero times; the header variable remains inside the loop scope."
      ],
      "description": "Counted for loop. A single initializer precedes a Boolean pretest; each completed body is followed by its assignment update and another test.",
      "source": {
        "model": "examples/notation/control-flow.swaml",
        "path": "ControlFlowNotation::Counter.countedLoop"
      },
      "drawing": {
        "template": "for-loop",
        "header": [
          "for"
        ],
        "lines": [
          "counted = counted + 1"
        ],
        "initializer": "var i: int = 0",
        "condition": "i < 3",
        "update": "i = i + 1",
        "bound": "3"
      }
    },
