<title id="title">Correlated case reply</title><desc id="desc">Correlated case reply. Draw a dashed reply arrow reversing the matching request route and label its step identity and correlation.</desc>
<g font-family="DejaVu Sans, sans-serif" stroke-width="1.5">
<rect x="0" y="0" width="560" height="320" rx="0" fill="#ffffff" stroke="none"/>
